    EntsAffected         kFoe
    Target               kCaster
    EnduranceCost        6.5
    TimeToActivate       2.1
    TimeToRoot           2.1
    RechargeTime         120
    EffectArea           kSphere
    Radius               10
    ServerTrayRequires   Temporary_Powers.Temporary_Powers.Hide_Kheldian_Server_Tray ownPower? !
    ServerTrayPriority   1000
    IgnoreLevelBought    kTrue
    NearGround           kTrue
    VisualFX             "menu/Powers/AnimFX/PlayerPowers/OriginPool_ForceOfWill_Stomp.PFX"
    include              menu/Powers/AnimFX/PlayerPowers/OriginPool_ForceOfWill_Stomp.PFX
